WEBVTT

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:01.351
silent,

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:02.684
eye level,

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:05.018
just feeling that moment.

00:05:05.042 --> 00:05:07.893
My heart was pounding
so hard I could hear it.

00:05:07.917 --> 00:05:09.226
That lump in my throat?

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.893
Ugh, I -- I could barely swallow.

00:05:11.917 --> 00:05:13.643
And you know what?

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:14.917
That's OK.

00:05:16.292 --> 00:05:20.893
Emotions and vulnerability
can be so hard for some people.

00:05:20.917 --> 00:05:22.393
I understand that.

00:05:22.417 --> 00:05:25.434
But in human moments, people want human.

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:29.559
They don't want a robotic police officer
or to be talking about paperwork.

00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:32.333
They just want another human
to connect to them.